    {
      "blocking": false,
      "code": "known-macos-issue",
      "detail": "On macOS 27.0.1, Apple's APFS resize has failed for another owner with error -69606 despite clean First Aid. If it fails here, nothing is installed and macOS stays as it was; going back to macOS 26 helped that owner. (https://github.com/AsahiLinux/asahi-installer/issues/448)"
    },
    {
      "blocking": true,
      "code": "existing-sekka",
      "detail": "A developer installation of Sekka, as install-sekka.sh makes, is on this Mac (Sekka): its EFI partition disk0s4 has the developer image's serial, 5ECC-A5E1. The installer won't install beside it or change it. To install Sekka here, copy off what you want to keep, then remove it in macOS: delete disk0s3, disk0s4 and disk0s5 with diskutil and grow macOS's container into the space (docs/apple-silicon/removal-and-boards.md)."
    }
  ],
